in place: one migration renames the column while old code is still serving

  before
      old_write ok   old_read 'old writer'
  renamed; old and new code both running
      old_write FAILS: no such column   new_write ok   old_read FAILS: no such column   new_read 'new writer'

expand and contract: five deploys, each safe to roll back

  1 expand: add the new column
      old_write ok   old_read 'old writer'
  2 deploy code that writes both
      old_write ok   dual_write ok   old_read 'dual writer'
  3 backfill the old rows
      dual_write ok   old_read 'dual writer'   new_read 'dual writer'
  4 deploy code that reads the new column
      dual_write ok   new_read 'dual writer'
  5 contract: drop the old column
      new_write ok   new_read 'new writer'

  rows without a value in the new column at the end: 0
